  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Your flight from LA to Tokyo curves up toward Alaska.",
      "t0": 0.03,
      "t1": 3.582
    },
    {
      "text": "And that curve is about three hundred miles SHORTER.",
      "t0": 3.932,
      "t1": 6.893
    },
    {
      "text": "Why?",
      "t0": 7.243,
      "t1": 7.789
    },
    {
      "text": "Because your flat map is lying.",
      "t0": 8.139,
      "t1": 10.461
    },
    {
      "text": "On a Mercator map, the straight line looks shortest.",
      "t0": 10.811,
      "t1": 13.934
    },
    {
      "text": "But Earth is a sphere, and the real shortest path is a great circle that bends north.",
      "t0": 14.284,
      "t1": 19.903
    },
    {
      "text": "So next time your flight tracker curves north...",
      "t0": 20.253,
      "t1": 22.726
    },
    {
      "text": "it's not a mistake.",
      "t0": 23.051,
      "t1": 23.85
    }
